server.dll is the CS2 server plugin from CS Demo Manager
https://github.com/akiver/cs-demo-manager (cs2-server-plugin/), MIT License.

Copyright (c) Anthony Killer (akiver)

Extracted from the official CS Demo Manager Windows release
(resources/static/cs2/server.dll). The plugin executes console commands at
specific demo ticks, driven by a <demo>.json actions file, and is loaded by
the game via a temporary gameinfo.gi search path entry.

If CS2 updates break demo playback automation, refresh this binary from the
latest CS Demo Manager release.
